Health check
Check whether your application is up.
http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
--
Application metrics
View available metric names and measurements.
http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics
--
Prometheus metrics
View the scrape-ready text format.
http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
--
Micrometer exposes metrics from your application;
Prometheus collects and stores them;
Grafana visualizes them. (Dashboards, graphs and alerts)


-- yml file
    > docker-compose.yml
    > Dockerfile
    > prometheus.yml
    > compose.yaml
